{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣網紅陳語謙2022年宣布結婚，並在隔年2月產下一女，過了一年再誕下兒子，升為二寶媽媽。</p><p>不過，現年30歲的她9月證實確診乳癌，目前正在接受化療，也持續在社群平台分享抗癌過程，而她近日再度於限時動態透露近況。</p><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189222898531831808740139.jpeg/5dIzIzL2p3e0usElmFdO5xQ_9pt1AA8kfbjlnX245Z0\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><p>更多台灣網紅陳語謙的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223313717596160823615.jpeg/tQUFvcR4cTfahqP1WdPHZEJZZVG70SIl8BOf9vATn_Y\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223316733431808710526.jpeg/7B0agTL4FgKsE4q8ghAPlBB9DpVURvhZ2GkgcNhpIHA\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223319677964288805421.jpeg/Z_HfoQijkJBpowBVCOQC7dxUPaBlsnrJawaovmsGqL4\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223321871716352976035.jpeg/wqqLpsk1aiC_ZOD8NoqTcY5n8xxMhFZrBAB1uAQAdbg\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223324774305792372694.jpeg/N-WYMgNzDHIY5dYY0y7ixCr8fD-4CFLnpFV6KaRVeik\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223296197988352408215.jpeg/EmsFFLDmNdsZFpw5NZoCKADXrPltg7yWhDvzLYQ78y0\"/><figcaption>台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣網紅陳語謙（Instagram@cyc.85）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189223298622427136018247.jpeg/Xc4w7nZmrxvVlpEwzUrA